      "spam": false,
      "value": "The main issue I see with this is that even for humanoids, bone orientations are not guaranteed to be consistent. So +Z may be down along the arm for one avatar, but for another avatar it may be +X. As a result, props like wristwatches wouldn't even work unless you allowed players to reposition and reorient them.\n\nPickup objects are special because the position is based off of the hand trackers which is guaranteed to be consistent regarding rotation.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
